  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>18</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> are in arithmetic progression and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>18</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> are also in arithmetic progression, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
